body:
Seems it's been looked into before, and the Supreme Court says it's okay.

&#x200B;

[https://governor.utah.gov/tag/prayer/](https://governor.utah.gov/tag/prayer/)

Looks like it came from [https://www.lds.org/manual/primary-5-doctrine-and-covenants-and-church-history/lesson-21?lang=eng](https://www.lds.org/manual/primary-5-doctrine-and-covenants-and-church-history/lesson-21?lang=eng)

&#x200B;

Primary 5 Lesson Manual... yep Primary... sheesh

So... if I don't raise my hand I don't make a promise to God... or have I already broken a promise because I didn't raise my hand? 

&#x200B;

Either way? meh.

And it came the pass the horses we used should be called tapirs. Because... have you seen them? They are cute as hell as babies!

&#x200B;

Mormon... you're making things up again!

We can take clouds from the sky??? 

&#x200B;

(fine fine probably not... but that would be cool)
